{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeP1xL5yZKgRYnkmSDZHC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01TGYxezMbz5LRXrSBPPoTNc","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kubernetes/website/main/content/en/docs/concepts/storage/projected-volumes.md","prompt":"I need exact quotations for a citation record. From this raw Markdown source of the Kubernetes \"Projected Volumes\" page, give me the complete, exactly-worded sentences (as direct quotations) from: the introduction; the list of volume sources that can be projected; the \"## serviceAccountToken projected volumes\" section (including sentences about the token's audience, validity duration / expirationSeconds, the token being invalidated when the Pod is deleted, and the kubelet requesting and storing the token on behalf of the Pod); and the \"## SecurityContext interactions\" section if present. Reproduce each sentence exactly, in quotation marks, grouped under its heading. Do not reword or summarize."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2746,"cache_read_input_tokens":127195,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2746},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ff5d535c-977f-479a-940c-05cafc9660f7","uuid":"53d10b30-62b6-426e-8f39-8c6335c96fea","timestamp":"2026-08-25T06:46:40.942Z","request_id":"req_011CeP1xKGND49RXK3p7pJx5"}
