{"type":"stream_event","event":{"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"ate. Every line below is a direct\nquotation from the named section.\n\n## emptyDir\n\n\"For a Pod that defines an `emptyDir` volume, the volume is created when the Pod is assigned to a node.\"\n\n\"As the name says"}},"session_id":"ff5d535c-977f-479a-940c-05cafc9660f7","parent_tool_use_id":null,"uuid":"c6ac38a8-625f-4cb2-a9f9-1c91e85e3a3a"}
